10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UxQdhHTMWxAQ7kNvwFKUdy6&_nc_oc=AdqfH7SvXgSw-pRijZAn-n6KXz2rPyFtDLFAifdDK1Ken62Viz-QHRkr-FBRvARCGfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx12MVb8e1LqGCrZ1BTzTSbzmj3gPukwF3djx7O4UFBtw&oe=69CA87CC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eOrbjNSY7LMQ7kNvwFRaVTS&_nc_oc=AdqpYFIKjcmJsY6mmBA_Mmo2BIBPc2MrX4zWyOtqjuDkBg6l7xeP0RjZiIcYy62tVM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwsE8km5p2lyK0zsSBJSmsGQKhfE-2LjGTEMQSD56xvmw&oe=69CA607C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sB8_lgSUxqoQ7kNvwHTlBDH&_nc_oc=AdrlZRXmlePnTJpKPrF8jaW-tvZdhmWpfccStAV2AElFJ2cTVkK9pTqKIc110RVVH6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxo69RIHZ8iAzOTL9Vk5vPJL_ZiGl-FVwAR5htcpDd1XQ&oe=69CA77AB"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore